'''Description:''' Clerics of the Air domain command power over creatures of the Elemental Planes and gain the ability to cast electrical damage spells.[[Image:Id air.gif|right|Air]]
== Domain Special Abilities ==

Able to [[Turn undead|turn]] [[elemental]]s as if they were [[undead]].

== Bonus Spells ==

* Level 3 [[Call lightning]]
* Level 6 [[Chain lightning]]

==Notes==
*The cleric can turn elementals without penalty as if they were undead.
*[[Sun domain]] improves the strength of turning.

